msgid "In the AI-driven enterprise world, applications must be intelligent, efficient, and production-ready. Quarkus isn’t just another Java framework—it’s a refined platform designed to deliver AI with performance, agility, and developer joy."
msgstr "在人工智能驱动的企业环境中，应用程序必须具备智能、高效且适合生产环境的特点。Quarkus 不仅仅是一个普通的 Java 框架——它是一个经过精心打磨的平台，旨在以卓越的性能、敏捷性和开发体验，助力人工智能的落地。"

